ng the quoted price of the respective crypto asset in the Company’s principal market at the time of recognition and is classified as a Level 1 measurement under ASC 820, Fair Value Measurement. The coins are recorded on the condensed consolidated balance sheets as crypto assets at their fair value and re-measured at each reporting date. Revaluation gains and losses are included in the condensed consolidated statements of operations.","section":"Item 1. Unaudited Financial Statements","block":98,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-003508","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001759186","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759186/000118518526003508/zsqr10q063026.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d4341edff2e55a3a5c4964e5870df80e00d86448736082947387e0e5406c93ec.bin","sha256":"d4341edff2e55a3a5c4964e5870df80e00d86448736082947387e0e5406c93ec"}},{"id":"7642dfb777d51b50f2dcce4fdd27ec8e8daa70f3654c2fbec19629cd84ef6cfd","quote":"The Company computes its interim income tax provision using an estimated annual effective tax rate applied to year-to-date pre-tax results, adjusted for discrete items recognized in the period. For the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company recognized no income tax expense or benefit, primarily due to the full valuation allowance maintained against its deferred tax assets.","context":"NOTE 15 – INCOME TAXES","section":"Item 1. Unaudited Financial Statements","block":252,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-003508","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001759186","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759186/000118518526003508/zsqr10q063026.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d4341edff2e55a3a5c4964e5870df80e00d86448736082947387e0e5406c93ec.bin","sha256":"d4341edff2e